{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9b01dd01-0d80-8022-86fd-29071b65e461",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T10:10:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Vincent DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:06:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:06:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Good morning. This is Vincent DeLuca. I'm calling about the storm drain in front of my house. The drain. It is not working right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:06:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. DeLuca. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:06:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Forty-five Mill Street. Up on the Hill. Forty-five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:06:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 45 Mill Street. What's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:07:00-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It grunts. I don't know how else to say it. It grunts, and it is slow. Any time we get a thaw, a little melt, it backs up. The water just sits there in the street and comes up over the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:07:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And there's no storm right now, it's just the melting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:07:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No storm. None. It's dry out, practically. That is what gets me. It doesn't take a storm. Just a warm afternoon, and there it is again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:07:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Again, so this has happened before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Many times. Every winter, and every time the snow goes. I have been looking at that drain for, well, a long, long time. Nobody comes. Nobody ever comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:07:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, that's aggravating. Is it leaving anything on the sidewalk when the water goes down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:07:58-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, yes. The sidewalk is a sheet of mud. Mud and grit. Sand, from the plowing, all of it washed down and left right there. I'm eighty-some years old, and I have to walk across that. It's a sheet. A sheet of mud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:08:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's not safe at all. So what you're asking for is to have the drain cleaned out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:08:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cleaned. Yes. That is all I want. Cleaned out, so it takes the water like it's supposed to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:08:32-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll put in a work order for a crew to look at the catch basin in front of 45 Mill. Is the water ever getting toward your house, or just the street and sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:08:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the street and the sidewalk. So far. I'd like to keep it that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:08:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Can I have a number in case somebody needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:09:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-oh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:09:03-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-oh. Perfect. I'm marking it as a drainage complaint, dry weather, so it doesn't get lost behind storm calls. Crews usually get to these in the order they come in, so it may be a few days, maybe into next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:09:21-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days. Next week. Well. That is better than never, I suppose. [pause] I'll say this. I sit at my front window in the evening, and the bridge, the Newport Bridge, it looks lovely lit up at night. Lovely. I'd just like the street to look as good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:09:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is a pretty view from up there. I'll make sure the note says the sidewalk is covered in mud and grit too, so they bring what they need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:09:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you. Please. Tell them it backs up on every thaw. Every one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:10:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll write that in. You take care, Mr. DeLuca, and watch your footing out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:10:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you, Denise. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
